{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1487","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"读一部经典小说，犹如进行一次奇异的漫游。翻开作品，我们便仿佛置身于不同时代、不同地域的社会生活之中，目睹各式各样的人生故事，探寻丰富多彩的心灵世界，感受多种多样的文化风貌。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元收入四部外国小说的节选。《大卫·科波菲尔》和《复活》是19 世纪现实主义长篇小说，展现了广阔的社会生活，表达了作者多方面的深刻思考；《老人与海》和《百年孤独》属于现代小说，在题材内容、创作手法等方面有诸多创新，极大地拓展了小说的天地。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，要联系相关的历史文化背景，体察小说展现的千姿百态的社会生活，感受人类文化的丰富多彩。要了解小说多样化的风格样式，从主题内容、叙事手法、语言风格等多方面入手把握作品独特的艺术成就；总结小说的艺术特点，提升鉴赏小说的能力，并尝试写小小说。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":138349,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/5/51372ab0bc5580a65cc8bf832fb826483eb6842c.jpeg","height":1146,"id":"media-f6e42b27d8ef50c70f88","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"aa2604e1e1c745abc9b113dcbbf8d84441976f2753a961d572c3e010640b8aa3","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/5/51372ab0bc5580a65cc8bf832fb826483eb6842c.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":807}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10019,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/5/51372ab0bc5580a65cc8bf832fb826483eb6842c.jpeg",